      "Language": "bul",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We describe a case of a patient with moderate hemophilia B, undergoing CABG. Substitution therapy was realized with factor IX concentrate (Bebulin-TIM4-IMMUNO). We discuss which of the following factors: hypothermia, hemodilution of heparinisation has a substantial role in alteration of FIX coagulant activity during cardiopulmonary bypass."},
